The files claude.toml and codex.toml in this directory are copied verbatim from
herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), src/detect/manifests/, at upstream
commit 2563803dca97c040beaf3dc3acdcb5a3221b4238. A daily workflow,
.github/workflows/herdr-manifests.yaml, opens a pull request when they change
upstream.

